<!-- =====================================================
     ANCIENT INDIAN YOGA PANORAMA
===================================================== -->

<section class="content-section">

```
<div class="container">

    <p class="eyebrow">
        OUR WIDER VISION
    </p>

    <h2>
        Ancient Indian Yoga Panorama
    </h2>

    <p>
        Yoga is not a single book, one posture or one school.
    </p>

    <p>
        It is a vast family of traditions that developed over
        centuries in India.
    </p>

    <div class="card-grid">

        <article class="card">
            <h3>Yoga</h3>
            <p>Disciplines of body, breath, mind and awareness.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
            <h3>Vedanta</h3>
            <p>Philosophical inquiry into reality, self and liberation.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
            <h3>Samkhya</h3>
            <p>A major philosophical framework connected historically with Yoga.</p>
        </article>

